IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0016.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY CRD0016C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 DC-CD              PIC X VALUE 'D'.
        88 DC-APPROVED VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM DECIDE-APPLICATION
    DISPLAY "DC-CD=" DC-CD
    STOP RUN.
DECIDE-APPLICATION.
    IF CS-SCR NOT < 720 AND D-IR < 0.40
        SET DC-APPROVED TO TRUE
    *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER
    ELSE IF CS-SCR GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 680
        MOVE 'R' TO DC-CD
    ELSE
        MOVE 'D' TO DC-CD
    END-IF
    END-IF.
